<title>JAPAN: West Japan Railway chugs along to record high.</title>
<headline>West Japan Railway chugs along to record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of West Japan Railway hit a record high in Monday afternoon trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0423 GMT, the shares had climbed 4,000 yen to 398,000 on the Tokyo bourse.  </p>
<p>&quot;There are some investors who were planning to buy the shares before the end of the fiscal year and haven't done so and they are rushing to buy before the share price climbs further,&quot; a broker at a &quot;Big Four&quot; brokerage said.</p>
</text>
